## uic-tape: the Tape Measure and guides (MOD-05)

uic-modeling-guide-on-the-line = The pointer is on the line. Move away from it to make a parallel guide.
uic-modeling-resize-range = The new length would scale the model by more than 1000 times or less than 1/1000. Check the unit.
uic-modeler-hint-tape-measure = Click the start, move, and click the end to see the distance. Click an edge and then away from it for a parallel guide. Click a point and then a direction for a guide line. Type a distance. Ctrl switches between guides and measuring only.
